title: Baltic Fleet Expansion
subtitle: A political question
tags: event
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_seen = 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/avrora.jpg
view-if: panzerkreuzer_b_seen = 0 and year = 1929 and month >= 12 and (rsdrp_in_government = 1 or rsdrp_toleration = 1)

= Baltic Fleet Expansion

The Navy is demanding the construction of a new battlecruiser. [? if panzerkreuzer_funded: The previous Military Expansion had been funded, and has already been launched. Constructing a battleship would futher progress Russia's armament programs. ?][? if not panzerkreuzer_funded: The previous Expansion Program requested by the Army was not funded, thanks to us. The military remains bitter, but nevertheless they are still pursuing their expansion plans, and must seek funding from the Duma. ?]

Much of our party is deeply opposed to armament and militarism, the Esers are, once again, split between their pacifist left and their liberal right, while the liberal and right parties are united in support. What will we do?

- @vote_yes: Vote yes, for constructing the battlecruiser.
- @vote_no: Vote no, against constructing the battlecruiser.
- @abstain: Abstain from the vote.
- @ministry: Use the War Ministry to prevent the construction.

@vote_yes
on-arrival: left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5 if not panzerkreuzer_funded; neorevisionist_dissent += 5 if not panzerkreuzer_funded; panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 1; rkp_coalition_dissent += 1; rkp_relation -= 6; workers_rsdrp -= 4; psr_right += 2

Our grassroots party members are highly critical of our decision. Many party branches have increased their agitation against our parliamentary fraction. [? if panzerkreuzer_funded : However, given the funding of the previous program, this seemed to be a foregone conclusion, and the reaction is muted. ?]

The vote in favor of the battlecruiser easily passes, with opposition only from the RKP. The ship will be built.

@vote_no
on-arrival: kadets_relation -= 8; z_relation -= 5; pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1; workers_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalism < 49; psr_left += 2; rkp_concil += 1
go-to: built if rsdrp_r + rkp_r + peacesr_r < 50; not_built if rsdrp_r + rkp_r + peacesr_r >= 50

Our vote against the battlecruiser is unpopular among the right-wing parties[? if in_grand_coalition or vremennyy_coalition: , including our coalition partners ?][? if rsdrp_toleration: , including the minority government that we are currently supporting ?].

@abstain
on-arrival: kadets_relation -= 5; z_relation -= 3; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5 if not panzerkreuzer_funded; panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 1; rkp_relation -= 3

The center-right parties are critical of our decision to abstain, and the pressure from our left flank is not entirely assuaged. Despite our abstention, the vote in the Duma passes, with all parties in favor except the RSDRP and RKP. The ship will be built.

[? if panzerkreuzer_funded : Given the previous expansion of the army, this seemed to be a foregone conclusion, and the reaction is muted. ?]

@built
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 1

Chancellor [+ chancellor +] brings the matter to a full Duma vote, which passes with all parties in favor except the RSDRP and RKP. The ship will be built.

@not_built
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 0; budget += 1 if panzerkreuzer_funded = 0

Our vote against the battlecruiser succeeds, with the support of the RKP and anti-war portions of the PSR. The ship will not be built! [? if panzerkreuzer_funded == 0 : We have saved some budget from not funding the military's whims. ?]

@ministry
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 0; budget += 1 if panzerkreuzer_funded = 0
view-if: reichswehr_minister_party == "RSDRP"

With our control of the War Ministry, we have pressured the Navy to abandon its expansion plans. The ship will not be built. [? if panzerkreuzer_funded == 0 : We have saved some budget from not funding the military's whims. ?]
